{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 30, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a journey to the land of rising sun\nA tale of Japan shall now be spun.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo's Realm**\n\nFrom distant shores thy vessel doth arrive\nAt Narita's gate where dreams revive.\nA taxi swift to Shinjuku's height\nA hotel awaits a wondrous sight.\nThen wander forth through gardens green\nWhere peace and beauty may be seen.\nDinner awaits a feast divine\nRamen's warmth a taste sublime.\n\n**Day Two: Tokyo's Wonders Unfold**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple we shall tread\nWhere ancient spirits softly tread.\nSenso-ji's gates a vibrant hue\nPrayers ascend to skies of blue.\nThen Shibuya's crossing a bustling show\nA human river to and fro.\nHarajuku's fashion a playful art\nYouthful spirits capture every heart.\n\n**Day Three: Hakone's Mountain Grace**\n\nA journey forth to Hakone's hold\nWhere mountains rise in stories told.\nLake Ashi's waters mirror bright\nMount Fuji's peak a glorious sight.\nA cruise we take a gentle ride\nThrough scenic beauty far and wide.\nThe Hakone Open-Air Museum's art\nA tranquil space to play a part.\n\n**Day Four: Kyoto's Ancient Charm**\n\nBy bullet train we swiftly fly\nTo Kyoto's grace beneath the sky.\nGion's district a geisha's place\nA glimpse of elegance and grace.\nKiyomizu-dera's wooden stage\nA panoramic view to engage.\nFushimi Inari's vermillion gates\nA thousand pathways seal thy fates.\n\n**Day Five: Kyoto's Temples Deep**\n\nKinkaku-ji's gold a dazzling gleam\nReflecting light a waking dream.\nRyoan-ji's garden stone and sand\nA meditative peace at hand.\nArashiyama's bamboo grove\nWhere whispering winds gently rove.\nTenryu-ji Temple's tranquil scene\nA verdant haven ever keen.\n\n**Day Six: Nara's Deer and History**\n\nTo Nara we journey near\nWhere friendly deer hold naught to fear.\nTodai-ji Temple grand and old\nWith Buddha's statue stories told.\nKasuga Taisha's lanterns bright\nIlluminating darkest night.\nA peaceful stroll a gentle pace\nIn Nara's beauty find thy grace.\n\n**Day Seven: Departure's Sad Embrace**\n\nAlas the journey nears its end\nA fond farewell to Japan friend.\nFrom Kansai's airport we take flight\nReturning home with memories bright.\nOf temples gardens mountains high\nBeneath the Japanese sunlit sky.\nUntil we meet again I pray\nFarewell dear Japan hooray.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.011765611357986927}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.5393308401107788}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.9428325891494751}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.0012685356196016073}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.07260698825120926}, {"token": "▁land", "logprob": -1.5020697116851807}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": "▁rising", "logprob": -1.4787747859954834}, {"token": "▁sun", "logprob": -0.00017677174764685333}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.533245861530304}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.003130893921479583}, {"token": "▁tale", "logprob": -2.0248637199401855}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.26465216279029846}, {"token": "▁Japan", "logprob": -0.31390461325645447}, {"token": "▁shall", "logprob": -1.255869746208191}, {"token": "▁now", "logprob": -0.023047078400850296}, {"token": "▁be", "logprob": -0.0014557965332642198}, {"token": "▁spun", "logprob": -0.0181638915091753}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.2622923254966736}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.000695463502779603}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.0031480062752962112}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.0026264239568263292}, {"token": "▁One", "logprob": -0.435120165348053}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.06356725096702576}, {"token": "▁Arrival", "logprob": -0.0011815002653747797}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": -0.00015293381875380874}, {"token": "▁Tokyo", "logprob": -0.11002689599990845}, {"token": "'", "logprob": -0.44501227140426636}, {"token": "s", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "▁Realm",